  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-444-602">先日手紙さし出し候あとにて箱が一ツある。宿のをかみさんが、もし是は何ンでござりますゾへ、こゝにわすれた。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-602-626">夫ハさておき今日</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-629-686"><seg source="#source-626-629">虎</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-650-671">（千屋寅之助）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-686-701">がきて心の</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-704-749"><seg source="#source-701-704">竹</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-725-734">（丈）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-749-776">をかきくどき彼一ツ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-782-830"><seg source="#source-776-782">けん</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-806-815">（件）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-830-881">を咄し聞候、今すこし御めいわくかけ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-881-896"><rb>金</rb><rt>かね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-896-920">でこふとハおもわ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-926-974"><seg source="#source-920-926">なだ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-950-959">（ん）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-974-1021">に、御気の毒様にて候。かしこ。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1021-1067" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1056-1067">十三日</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1067-1151" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1102-1107">〆</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-1107-1119">寺田屋様</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1119-1151" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1137-1151">うめより</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1151-1233" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1186-1197">御直披</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
